== Overview ==
The '''Parasite Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that can stun [[units]] by hopping on them. This is the first variation of the Parasite Toilets.

== Appearance ==
It is a white toilet with 8 spider-like legs and has a different cistern than the other toilets. It's toilet bowl is also stretched.  

== Waves ==
''40-60''

== Abilities ==
It is able to control your units and stun them.

== Strategy ==
Use [[Medic Cameraman]], [[Camera Repair Drone]], or [[Speaker Repair Drone]] to unstun your units.

== Trivia ==

* This unit is based off the Parasite Toilet from the series.
* There has been a [[Helicopter Parasite Toilet]], a parasite that can stun Titans, debuted in Episode 57, however, this enemy debuted in Episode 30, but was added on the [[Episode 69 Part 1 Update|Episode 69 Part 1 update]].
* Cannot stun all Large units except for [[Large Fanman]], [[Large Forcefield Cameraman]] and [[Rainbow Future Large Clockman]].

